Package: MannWhitneyCopula
Type: Package
Title: Computing Mann-Whitney Effect Based on Copulas
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Kosuke", family = "Nakazono", email = "nakazono@ism.ac.jp", role =c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computing the Mann-Whitney effect based on copula models. 
     Estimation of the association parameter in survival copula models.
     A description of the underlying methods is described in Nakazono et al. (2024) <doi:10.3390/math12101453> and Nakazono et al. (accepted for publication in Statistical Papers).
